{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56646","headline":"赠段文昌 · 无名氏","name":"赠段文昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日骑驴学忍饥，今朝忽着锦衣归。\n等闲画虎驱红旆，可畏登龙入紫微。\n富贵不由翁祖（一作「簪组」）解，文章生得羽毛飞。\n广都再去应惆怅，犹有江边旧钓矶。\n（见蜀何光远《监戒录》卷八「衣锦归」条。\n）（〖1〗《监戒录》云：「段相国文昌本广都人，父以油柞爲业。\n生而有致，长亦多才，物业荡空，文章回振。\n洎跨卫行卷，乡里笑之历三十年间，衣锦还蜀，蜀人有诗赠曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}